--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- single taut nylon mooring, fully suspended (no seabed), static IC
-- Synthetic nylon rope modelled with a linear-EA approximation (the Syrope working-curve model is
-- a separate advanced dialect). Nylon is much softer than polyester and only slightly net-heavy:
-- diam 0.18 m, dry mass 33 kg/m (displaced ~26 kg/m), static EA 5.0e7 N. A soft taut leg -- the
-- low EA lets the ~635 m chord stretch under load. No WtrDpth => fully suspended, no seabed.
